{"posts":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"6a9801a838c8afd44753c899","text":"Container Days Hamburg 2026 is on! \n\nDifferent location, some new people, some \"old\", the same awsome vibe and so many smart people in one location!\n\nA lot of focus on Sovereign solutions this year, following the trend. BWI first out with a great talk about what they've done for Bundeswehr (German armed forces) with Open Source Software for a secure, sovereign platform.\n\nAnd of course, the mandatory Fritz-kola fridge!\n\n#cds2026 #kubernetes #containersarefun\n\n","status":"sent","dueAt":"2026-09-02T10:59:52.538Z","channelId":"681cb313556664dc1086cbca","externalLink":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:ugcPost:7500870200171548673","shareMode":"shareNow","via":"buffer","assets":[{"thumbnail":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9800be5bf052e63a08dec0/0b62e04612eccae5141acfa8f59dc804.original.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","source":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9800be5bf052e63a08dec0/0b62e04612eccae5141acfa8f59dc804.original.jpg"},{"thumbnail":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9800c0b2997de3a407cd6c/1549bae770d84e8c8ed0b9e95e92e3c0.original.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","source":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9800c0b2997de3a407cd6c/1549bae770d84e8c8ed0b9e95e92e3c0.original.jpg"},{"thumbnail":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9800c49f49bd037b0ef301/e5058b37bf6597b5d454a1a18b374d39.original.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","source":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9800c49f49bd037b0ef301/e5058b37bf6597b5d454a1a18b374d39.original.jpg"}],"metrics":[{"type":"reactions","name":"Reactions","value":4,"unit":"count"},{"type":"comments","name":"Comments","value":0,"unit":"count"},{"type":"engagementRate","name":"Eng. Rate","value":10.53,"unit":"percentage"},{"ty